_:nab72972d56824928a4c1ac3e1d2dc4c5b7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Either a rml:subject, rml:subjectMap is required, not multiple.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalViewShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A logical view (rml:LogicalView) is a type of abstract logical source that is derived from another abstract logical source by defining fields with data from said abstract logical source.\n    " .
_:nbc4fe69998e247569e5fc1f5ded054c4b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:reference must be a string.\n        " .
_:nb73edd47c00f46e79cf722edd06272aeb6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
