_:n2742bcacb0ab478e81d7e95d73db5444b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        A structural annotation of the logical view.\n        " .
_:n6e2566fddb294257981169e58a78115fb16 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLReturnMapShape> .
