_:nab72972d56824928a4c1ac3e1d2dc4c5b25 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:nab72972d56824928a4c1ac3e1d2dc4c5b23 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    Structural annotations provide a mechanism to express relationships between logical views, as well as additional information about fields.\r\n    " .
_:nab72972d56824928a4c1ac3e1d2dc4c5b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/subjectMap> .
_:nab72972d56824928a4c1ac3e1d2dc4c5b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:nab72972d56824928a4c1ac3e1d2dc4c5b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "logicalSource" .
_:n8175924ae17b47c0977b96415b12e1a6b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n8175924ae17b47c0977b96415b12e1a6b6 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    Node must have a valid rml:StructuralAnnotationShape description.\r\n    All structural annotations of a logical view lv MUST have an on fields property (rml:onFields), linking the structural annotation to a list of field names occurring in lv.\r\n    rml:StructuralAnnotationShape requires:\r\n    - exactly one rml:onFields property.\r\n    " .
_:n5b6bd90f20e74ce7895ddc948c066175b8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLDatatypeMapShape> .
_:n15b463a3483f4606814422b1cf328bb5b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLJoinShape> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/LeafExpressionFieldShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    A leaf expression field is an expression field without nested fields.\r\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLIterableShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    An abstract construct to describe data access and iteration for a data source.\r\n    " .
_:n9082615611bd4a9bacd18c8d66a4a7ceb5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A PredicateMap element to generate the predicate component of the \n        (predicate, object) pair from a logical table row or iterator.\n        " .
_:N3a2520ec27e74f0fa90d62f9f99df5b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:ndc976acf63a84a7a81e300611440577ab7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:ndc976acf63a84a7a81e300611440577ab8 .
_:nf571a14f236b4d6e9f4c6c67a6ac86dbb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        rml:iterator specifies the iterator to iterate over\r\n        the data source, and may be provided at most once.\r\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#or> _:n136e17da7b9946b2b12fc1be804efd8eb12 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLRefObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:nab72972d56824928a4c1ac3e1d2dc4c5b26 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:nab72972d56824928a4c1ac3e1d2dc4c5b24 .
_:n9082615611bd4a9bacd18c8d66a4a7ceb16 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the object for the generated RDF triples.\n        " .
_:nbc4fe69998e247569e5fc1f5ded054c4b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
